  "name": "Weekly workflow diagram to Slack",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3c962ff8-9845-44cb-b0a8-2e11e4db7a3c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## Weekly workflow diagram to Slack\n\n### How it works\n\nEvery Monday at 9am this fetches one of your n8n workflows, renders it as an image, and posts it to a Slack channel.\n\nThe image is generated from the workflow JSON, so it cannot drift from what the workflow actually does. That is the reason to run it on a schedule instead of taking a screenshot once.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Schedule trigger: set your timezone and run time.\n2. n8n credential (Settings, then API), then pick the workflow to document.\n3. Pixtex needs no credential. It renders straight away, with a small watermark. A free key raises your limits; Pro removes the watermark.\n4. Slack credential, then choose the channel.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the schedule, the workflow, the channel, or the render options.\n\nSet Format to PDF for a client-ready document, or swap Slack for Gmail, Drive or Telegram. The image is just binary data on the item."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a2a48cbb-1a32-485a-8faf-be54969aa2af",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Schedule and fetch workflow\n\nStarts the automation on a weekly Monday schedule and retrieves the workflow data that will be turned into a diagram."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2f8ec415-3a25-463d-be5d-b02a02614b84",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1008,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Render and post diagram\n\nConverts the retrieved workflow into an image and sends that rendered diagram to Slack.\n\nNo Pixtex credential is required here."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "22319caa-2774-4d7d-88b5-078e5cf167fb",
      "name": "When Every Monday at 9am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        608,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "fac668dd-520d-4af5-85e2-24031b0935c0",
      "name": "Fetch Current Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.n8n",
      "position": [
        832,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7ac21a58-b451-448c-bcdf-7efd48e5f6bc",
      "name": "Convert Workflow to Image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-pixtex.pixtex",
      "position": [
        1056,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "format": "png",
        "options": {
          "scale": 2,
          "iconPack": "n8n",
          "showTitle": true,
          "background": "dark"
        },
        "resource": "render",
        "operation": "render",
        "workflowJson": "={{ $json }}",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e6eedb63-4375-46f9-a724-6f80ad3f3b0b",
      "name": "Upload to Slack Channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        1280,
        240
      ],
      "webhookId": "62d2f022-5af7-4dad-8013-c10351cb04b3",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "resource": "file"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.4
    }
